msgid "With this setting, any product that expires by %s goes out of stock today, and its details are included in the email reports."
msgstr "با این تنظیم، هر محصولی که تا %s منقضی شود، از همین امروز ناموجود می‌شود و اطلاعات محصول در گزارش‌های ایمیلی هم درج می‌شود."

#: views/settings/general.php:79
msgid "Automatic stock restore"
msgstr "برگشت خودکار موجودی"

#: views/settings/general.php:80
msgid "If you clear or extend a product's expiration date, its stock returns to the status it had before it went out of stock. This only applies to products the plugin itself set out of stock."
